<h2>1. Model Specifications</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Specification</th><th>Value</th></tr>
<tr><td>Model Name</td><td>google/gemma-4-31b-it</td></tr>
<tr><td>Parameters</td><td>31 Billion (Dense)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Model Size on Disk (BF16)</td><td>~65 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>VRAM Required (FP16/BF16)</td><td>~71 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>VRAM Required (NVFP4 Quantized)</td><td>~45 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Minimum GPU</td><td>1x NVIDIA A100 80GB (single GPU) or 2x A100 40GB (tensor parallel)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Recommended Serving Engine</td><td>vLLM v0.8.0+</td></tr>
<tr><td>Context Length</td><td>Up to 256K tokens</td></tr>
<tr><td>Source</td><td>JFrog Artifactory (artifacts.cat.com) - Approved</td></tr>
<tr><td>Artifactory Path</td><td>cat-huggingface-repo/models/google/gemma-4-31B-it/</td></tr>
</table>


<h2>2. AEX Model Service - Available Deployment Paths</h2>
<p>The CMAAI-Model-Service GitHub Actions workflow (cmaai-model-service.yaml) supports the following model-type options:</p>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>model-type</th><th>Description</th><th>Applicable to Gemma 4 31B?</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>huggingface</td><td>Deploy HuggingFace model on AEX infrastructure (ECS/EC2 with GPU)</td><td class="warn">Yes - but likely fails due to size</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>sagemaker</td><td>Deploy via Amazon SageMaker endpoint</td><td class="pass">Yes - most viable AEX path</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>mlflow</td><td>Deploy MLflow model</td><td class="fail">No - not applicable for LLMs</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>pythonpackage</td><td>Deploy Python package model</td><td class="fail">No - not applicable</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td>llmobject</td><td>Deploy LLM object</td><td class="warn">Possibly - needs investigation</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>3. OPTION 1: AEX &rarr; model-type = "huggingface"</h2>
<h3>Description</h3>
<p>Model artifacts stored in S3 are pulled to a worker node and loaded into GPU memory for inference.</p>

<h3>Feasibility Assessment</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Current AEX Limit</th><th>Gemma 4 31B Needs</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>Worker Ephemeral Storage</td><td>20 GiB (default)</td><td>65+ GB</td><td class="fail">FAILS</td></tr>
<tr><td>GPU VRAM</td><td>Unknown (depends on provisioned instance)</td><td>71 GB (FP16) / 45 GB (NVFP4)</td><td class="warn">UNKNOWN</td></tr>
<tr><td>S3 Download Time</td><td>Unknown timeout threshold</td><td>~5-10 min for 65 GB at 200 MB/s</td><td class="warn">RISK</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cold Start Time</td><td>Unknown health check timeout</td><td>2-5 minutes (model loading + warmup)</td><td class="warn">RISK</td></tr>
<tr><td>ECR Image Layer Size</td><td>52 GB max per layer</td><td>65 GB model cannot fit in image</td><td class="fail">FAILS</td></tr>
</table>


