</table>
<p><strong>Verdict:</strong> <span class="fail">LIKELY FAILS</span> - Worker ephemeral storage (20 GiB) and ECR layer limit (52 GB) are insufficient for 65 GB model.</p>


<h2>4. OPTION 2: AEX &rarr; model-type = "sagemaker"</h2>
<h3>Description</h3>
<p>Model is packaged as model.tar.gz, uploaded to S3, and deployed to a SageMaker real-time inference endpoint via the CMAAI-Model-Service workflow.</p>

<h3>Feasibility Assessment</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Requirement</th><th>SageMaker Capability</th><th>Gemma 4 31B Needs</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>Model packaging (tar.gz)</td><td>S3 multipart upload, no hard size limit</td><td>65 GB tar.gz</td><td class="pass">PASS (slow to create)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Storage on endpoint instance</td><td>Configurable EBS volume</td><td>65+ GB</td><td class="pass">PASS</td></tr>
<tr><td>GPU availability</td><td>Multiple GPU instance families</td><td>A100 80GB min for FP16</td><td class="pass">PASS</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cold start</td><td>Instance launch + model load</td><td>5-15 minutes total</td><td class="warn">PASS (slow)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Inference timeout (real-time)</td><td>Up to 60 seconds response</td><td>Depends on output length</td><td class="warn">RISK for long outputs</td></tr>
<tr><td>Gemma 4 on JumpStart</td><td>Available since April 2026</td><td>Pre-configured deployment</td><td class="pass">CONFIRMED</td></tr>
</table>

