<h2>5. OPTION 3: SageMaker JumpStart (Direct - Bypasses AEX)</h2>
<h3>Description</h3>
<p>Gemma 4 models are pre-registered in SageMaker JumpStart (confirmed available since April 2026). Deploy directly from SageMaker Studio or Python SDK. No manual model packaging required.</p>
