<tr><td>GPU instances available?</td><td class="pass">PASS</td><td>Same instances as Option 2</td></tr>
<tr><td>Integration with AEX pipeline?</td><td class="fail">FAILS</td><td>Not managed through CMAAI-Model-Service workflow</td></tr>
