<h2>10. Gaps Identified in AEX Model Service</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>Gap</th><th>Current State</th><th>Required for Gemma 4 31B</th><th>Priority</th><th>Impact</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Worker ephemeral storage too small</td><td>20 GiB default</td><td>100+ GiB</td><td class="fail">P0 - Critical</td><td>Cannot store 65 GB model on worker</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>No JFrog-to-S3 transfer automation</td><td>Manual download required</td><td>Automated pipeline</td><td class="fail">P0 - Critical</td><td>65 GB cannot be manually transferred efficiently</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>ECR image layer size limit</td><td>52 GB max per layer</td><td>Use runtime S3 pull instead</td><td class="warn">P1 - High</td><td>Cannot bake 65 GB model into container image</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>No GPU instance type selection in workflow</td><td>Not configurable by user</td><td>User-selectable GPU instance type</td><td class="warn">P1 - High</td><td>Cannot specify A100/H100 for large models</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td>No tensor parallelism configuration</td><td>Not supported</td><td>TP=1,2,4,8 configurable</td><td class="warn">P2 - Medium</td><td>Multi-GPU inference required for large models</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td>Cold start/health check timeout too short</td><td>Unknown (likely &lt; 5 min)</td><td>10-15 minutes for LLM loading</td><td class="warn">P2 - Medium</td><td>Model loading takes 2-5 min minimum</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td>No model quantization pipeline</td><td>Not available</td><td>NVFP4/INT8 quantization support</td><td>P3 - Low</td><td>Would reduce model from 65 GB to ~20 GB</td></tr>
</table>


